OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThree sisters who drowned in sea off
OL,4,ABrighton took own lives, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 11 May, the women - who had all been
OL,7,Fliving together in Greenford, London -
OL,8,Fvisited an area of Birmingham close to
OL,9,Fwhere their mother died before
OL,10,Ftravelling the next day to Brighton
OL,11,Fbeach, where they drowned in adverse
OL,12,Fsea conditions in the early hours of 13
OL,13,FMay. The coroner said they could not
OL,14,Fswim.
OL,16,FTheir father Joseph Jacobsen said it
OL,17,Fwas heartbreaking to lose "all three of
OL,18,Fmy precious daughters".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
