OL,3,ARoyal Navy sailor in court accused of
OL,4,Apreparing to spy for Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FA junior Royal Navy sailor has appeared
OL,7,Fin court accused of preparing to spy
OL,8,Ffor Russia.
OL,10,FAble Seaman Teddy Young, who
OL,11,Fspecialised in warfare intelligence,
OL,12,Fappeared in the dock at Westminster
OL,13,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday after
OL,14,Fbeing charged under the National
OL,15,FSecurity Act.
OL,17,FIt is alleged that while serving as a
OL,18,FWarfare Intelligence Rating, the
OL,19,F24-year-old retained UK defence and
OL,20,Fintelligence material that he had
OL,21,Faccess to, and made preparations to
OL,22,Fdisclose sensitive information.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
