OL,3,ARoyal Navy sailor in court accused of
OL,4,Apreparing to spy for Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands that the
OL,7,Fallegations include translating a
OL,8,Fmessage into Russian, and looking for a
OL,9,Fweb portal that invited people to
OL,10,Fsubmit information to Russia.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
