OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS and Lebanon protecting wanted Syrian
OL,4,Ageneral, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation by the BBC and the US
OL,7,Fbroadcaster NPR has discovered that
OL,8,FHassan has been allowed to remain there
OL,9,Funder an arrangement involving the FBI,
OL,10,Fand other US and Lebanese authorities.
OL,11,FThis is because of his willingness to
OL,12,Fprovide information about the abduction
OL,13,Fof American journalist Austin Tice in
OL,14,FSyria in 2012, as well as additional
OL,15,Fintelligence, we have been told.
OL,17,FLast month the BBC revealed Tice's
OL,18,Fabduction had been a planned operation,
OL,19,Fwith Hassan in the chain of command.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
